1
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:20,480
Lao Wang,

2
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:21,980
what else did you find?

3
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,680
This is a piece of paper

4
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:25,539
with a colorful krait drawn on it.

5
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:30,360
As for Jinwen,

6
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:32,820
I never thought highly of him from the start.

7
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:34,120
Find someone better.

8
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:35,770
He doesn't deserve you.

9
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:42,320
This is what I found last night.

10
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,840
Hengtong Warehouse.

11
00:01:48,039 --> 00:01:48,400
Yes.

12
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,560
That's the primary crime scene.

13
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,490
That's where Jinwen was murdered.

14
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,759
Superintendent Li,

15
00:01:53,759 --> 00:01:54,759
I received a tip

16
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:56,160
that people from Hengtong Company

17
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:57,400
will be at Xihe Pier tonight

18
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,960
trading with smugglers.

19
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,280
It's very likely related

20
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:01,610
to Lin Jinwen's murder.

21
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,890
Isn't this Hengtong Warehouse

22
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,160
owned by your father?

23
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,360
Are you trying to place justice above family?

24
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,840
As a police officer,

25
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:10,960
my mission is to find the truth.

26
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,160
Superintendent Li,

27
00:02:12,160 --> 00:02:14,160
we must deploy our forces immediately

28
00:02:14,160 --> 00:02:15,040
and prepare for an arrest.

29
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,240
Jiang Siyao,

30
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:18,520
have you forgotten how Lin Jinwen died?

31
00:02:18,760 --> 00:02:19,880
Being so rash and eager for credit

32
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:21,640
will only get you killed.

33
00:02:22,079 --> 00:02:23,440
You caused a scene at the Lei residence last night,

34
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,760
and I haven't even settled that with you yet.

35
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:27,160
Now you want to mess with Hengtong Company.

36
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:29,040
Fine.

37
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:31,079
Let me report to the mayor first.

38
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,560
Superintendent Li,

39
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:35,220
then you can wait by yourself.

40
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:38,600
You...

41
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:39,520
I...

42
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,079
You can't act on your own!

43
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:44,079
Hurry up, get moving!

44
00:02:44,079 --> 00:02:44,480
Hurry!

45
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,560
What are you doing?

46
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,000
Hurry!

47
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,520
Don't waste time!

48
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:48,360
Slow down.

49
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:50,600
Keep up!

50
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,380
Move it faster!

51
00:02:54,160 --> 00:02:55,079
Be careful.

52
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,640
There's another one over there.

53
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:00,920
Hurry up.

54
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:02,120
Nobody move!

55
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:06,920
Don't move!

56
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,290
Hands on your heads!

57
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:30,640
Coffee beans.

58
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:40,760
Inspector Jiang,

59
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:43,360
I've always run a legitimate business.

60
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,560
I never do anything illegal.

61
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,200
Today,

62
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:48,820
without any explanation,

63
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:51,010
you brought people to search my goods.

64
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,760
About this matter,

65
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:54,820
I will go to Superintendent Li

66
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,060
and demand a proper explanation.

67
00:03:57,360 --> 00:03:58,160
Boss Jiang,

68
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,920
are you scared?

69
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,280
What would I be scared of?

70
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:03,760
Inspector Jiang,

71
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:04,740
let me tell you,

72
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:06,580
this batch of goods

73
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,130
has all the proper customs documents.

74
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,570
Search all you want.

75
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:12,370
Go ahead.

76
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,320
Uncle Jiang,

77
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:17,040
we came today to ask for your advice.

78
00:04:18,160 --> 00:04:19,959
What does this drawing mean?

79
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,560
This is the logo of a newly established

80
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,840
coffee company abroad.

81
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,140
It's called Snake,

82
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:30,680
which means snake.

83
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,400
This company

84
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,440
opened in one of the best regions

85
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,800
in the world,

86
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,840
called Ethiopia.

87
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:39,440
Are you satisfied

88
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:41,159
with this answer?

89
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:50,520
You heartless thing.

90
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:52,280
Your mother died early,

91
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,610
and I raised you single-handedly.

92
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:56,159
Is this how you repay me?

93
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:58,880
Whenever I close my eyes now,

94
00:04:58,880 --> 00:05:01,120
I see Jinwen dying in front of me.

95
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:03,760
I won't let him die in vain.

96
00:05:03,880 --> 00:05:05,040
Shut up.

97
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,960
For someone like Lin Jinwen,

98
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,240
you dare to bite the hand that feeds you.

99
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,960
What exactly did Jinwen do wrong

100
00:05:10,960 --> 00:05:12,320
for you to treat him like this?

101
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:14,250
From the moment he approached you,

102
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:16,480
he had bad intentions.

103
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,320
I really don't understand.

104
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:22,120
What kind of spell did he cast on you?

105
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:24,240
To make you so devoted,

106
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:26,960
thinking his scheming was actually love.

107
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,160
Dad.

108
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,970
I just want to ask you one thing.

109
00:05:35,159 --> 00:05:36,290
Does Jinwen's death

110
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,840
have anything to do with you?

111
00:05:39,280 --> 00:05:39,680
You...

112
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:42,200
You bastard!

113
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:43,760
Get out!

114
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:45,120
Get out!

115
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,560
Get out of this house!

116
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:01,880
Senior Sister,

117
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,530
why don't you come back to the sect with me?

118
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,760
I keep feeling that Jinwen's death

119
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,840
wasn't that simple.

120
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,640
I also think it's a bit fishy.

121
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:12,360
If they were just trading coffee beans,

122
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:14,160
why be so sneaky?

123
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,640
In the operation just now,

124
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:17,880
the original goods might have been switched.

125
00:06:17,880 --> 00:06:19,480
Those clues in the warehouse

126
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:22,040
seemed like they were waiting for us to find them.

127
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,840
I asked a friend overseas

128
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:24,160
who does trade to look into it.

129
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:24,760
In Ethiopia,

130
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:27,020
there is no coffee company called Snake.

131
00:06:27,920 --> 00:06:29,160
Senior Sister.

132
00:06:30,080 --> 00:06:33,240
Why would Uncle Jiang lie?

133
00:06:33,880 --> 00:06:34,810
I'll go find him.

134
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:36,720
Miss,

135
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:38,580
the master went to the pier again.

136
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:45,840
Detective Jiang,

137
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:46,770
my condolences.

138
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:50,800
Dad.

139
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,440
Dad.

140
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,440
Dad.

141
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:20,280
You look

142
00:07:20,640 --> 00:07:22,040
really beautiful today.

143
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,580
Get out.

144
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,159
Never step into this house again.

145
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:32,640
Get out.

146
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,090
We are getting married.

147
00:07:39,159 --> 00:07:39,960
Come with me.

148
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,159
I was wrong.

149
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,120
I shouldn't have hit you.

150
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:55,320
Dad,

151
00:07:55,960 --> 00:07:56,920
what are you doing?

152
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,760
What are you doing, Dad?

153
00:07:57,760 --> 00:07:59,360
I'm going to kill him.

154
00:07:59,560 --> 00:07:59,880
No.

155
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,760
I saw them.

156
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,720
I just saw them.

157
00:08:08,280 --> 00:08:11,120
My dad, Jinwen, they were right in front of me.

158
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:12,960
Don't leave me.

159
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:13,840
Calm down.

160
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,480
Don't leave me.

161
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:17,040
Senior Sister, don't leave me.

162
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,720
Calm down. I won't leave you.

163
00:08:19,080 --> 00:08:20,160
Don't leave me.

164
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,640
Don't leave me.

165
00:08:27,360 --> 00:08:28,760
What's wrong with her?

166
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,160
In such a short time,

167
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:32,320
she lost her fiancé and her father.

168
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:34,080
She couldn't accept it all at once

169
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:34,919
and had a hysterical episode.

170
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,159
Let her get some rest.

171
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:03,320
Senior Sister.

172
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:04,960
Why are you in my house?

173
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:06,440
You...

174
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:09,620
Are you hungry?

175
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,820
I'm not hungry.

176
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:11,920
Let's go

177
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:12,980
to the crime scene.

178
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:15,040
Break...

179
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:17,620
Emerge from the cocoon like a butterfly.

180
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,020
Reborn from the ashes.

181
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,720
What are you looking for?

182
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,560
I'll help you.

183
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:44,420
Bullet casings or ballistic traces.

184
00:09:53,320 --> 00:09:54,180
Senior Sister.

185
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:57,480
Look.

186
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,160
This is exactly the same as the bullet

187
00:10:02,160 --> 00:10:04,160
Jinwen held in his hand when he died.

188
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:10,880
It's a dumdum bullet.

189
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,120
A dumdum bullet again.

190
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:14,160
Little bandit,

191
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:16,610
how do you know about special bullets?

192
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:18,420
Senior Sister,

193
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,440
please control her.

194
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,840
What's gotten into her now?

195
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:22,300
Who is your Senior Sister?

196
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:23,960
Ye Shian,

197
00:10:24,480 --> 00:10:26,480
you really know a bit too much.

198
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:31,240
I'm a miner from Xinfeng Stronghold.

199
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:33,600
We use guns to blast mines every day.

200
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:36,360
Of course I know something about this.

201
00:10:38,080 --> 00:10:38,720
I swear,

202
00:10:39,080 --> 00:10:41,360
I have no ulterior motives in helping Detective Jiang solve cases.

203
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:43,000
I just want to find the lost brothers

204
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,260
of Xinfeng Stronghold

205
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,640
and find out the truth.

206
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:46,960
Okay.

207
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,720
The gods are watching from above.

208
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,560
If you dare to betray your oath,

209
00:10:51,560 --> 00:10:52,920
I'll be the first to strike you with lightning.

210
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:54,360
Rule number two.

211
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:55,440
Okay.

212
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:57,320
Don't make promises lightly.

213
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,120
Got it.

214
00:10:58,360 --> 00:11:00,680
The one who said he would spend the rest of his life with me

215
00:11:00,680 --> 00:11:01,960
was the first to leave.

216
00:11:05,880 --> 00:11:07,140
Hengshunxing Grocery

217
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,760
Boss.

218
00:11:10,360 --> 00:11:11,120
Officer,

219
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,370
what do you need?

220
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,280
Our shop has everything you could possibly want.

221
00:11:14,280 --> 00:11:15,680
Come, have a seat inside.

222
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,360
Who bought this?

223
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,400
Officer,

224
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:25,120
we run a legitimate business here.

225
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,920
We wouldn't dare sell such things.

226
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:29,160
The biggest black market on Fenghuang Street.

227
00:11:29,160 --> 00:11:31,360
You sell daily necessities on the surface,

228
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:33,960
but smuggle contraband in private.

229
00:11:33,960 --> 00:11:35,890
Did you really think I didn't know?

230
00:11:35,920 --> 00:11:37,000
Even the police can't

231
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:39,060
wrong innocent people for no reason.

232
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:40,240
Besides,

233
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:42,160
look whose turf you're on.

234
00:11:42,760 --> 00:11:43,760
Jiuhe Gang.

235
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,200
You know and still dare to be so arrogant?

236
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,200
See the guest out.

237
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:49,440
Speak.

238
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:51,640
Has anyone bought special dumdum bullets?

239
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:52,440
Yes, yes, yes.

240
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,320
I don't know this person either.

241
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:55,800
You don't know?

242
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,960
I really don't know.

243
00:11:58,200 --> 00:12:00,200
I only know he has a scar on his face.

244
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:02,520
Someone saw him at a dance hall.

245
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:03,680
Which dance hall?

246
00:12:04,280 --> 00:12:05,360
Changlemen.

247
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:08,090
You only speak when asked, huh?

248
00:12:08,760 --> 00:12:09,760
What else?

249
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,160
He...

250
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,520
His name is Zheng Kun.

251
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:14,050
He seems to be left-handed.

252
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:16,520
Left-handed?
